 # Views block override

-This module allows overriding views contextual arguments and exposing sort from
-the block setting form.
+This module allows overriding block displays per block instance. Allowed
+overrides are provided through display/block/override plugins.
+
+Available out-of-the-box overrides are:
+- Items per page (default core override)
+- Pager ID (override the pager id)
+- More link Text (override the "more"-link text)
+- More link Url (override the "more"-link URL)
+- Contextual filters (override the available contextual filters)
+- Exposed sort (override default sort by and order settings)

 For a full description of the module, visit the
 [project page](https://www.drupal.org/project/views_block_override).
